    "name": "Meowingtons Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 2766880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get ready to take control of the most unique dance party ever with Meowingtons and pals! In this ragdoll dancing simulator, you\u2019ll use intuitive controls to move Meowingtons to the beat of the music. Create hilariously chaotic dance routines, time your moves with the rhythm, and make that goofy cat bounce around.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/bfd4c2b6d3cdeb84195732fa3d891ef3.poster.avif?t=1746590644\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/bfd4c2b6d3cdeb84195732fa3d891ef3.webm?t=1746590644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragdoll Dance Mechanics:</strong> In <i>Meowingtons Simulator</i>, every move hits the beat. The dance system is fully synced to the music, meaning each action you take lands perfectly in rhythm\u2014no off-beat flailing allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Meowingtons\u2019 head or butt independently using simple impulse sliders. Launch his limbs, pose mid-air, or smash into the club walls\u2014all while grooving to the track. The result? A glorious mess of rhythm, ragdoll physics, and feline flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the controls to create beautifully synchronized chaos\u2014or just let the beat take control and see what happens. Either way, it\u2019s hilarious, satisfying, and endlessly remixable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/d5617e68a99342cd789dd502e3d82ba1.poster.avif?t=1746590644\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/d5617e68a99342cd789dd502e3d82ba1.webm?t=1746590644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Cat. Style Your Chaos:</strong> Before you hit the dance floor, make sure you\u2019re looking fresh. Meowingtons Simulator lets you choose from a variety of cat skins, each with its own unique look\u2014from sleek and stylish to funky and bold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve picked your cat, dress them up with cosmetics you\u2019ve collected. Whether it's a pair of shades, a shiny chain, or a full custom Mau5head, there are plenty of ways to stand out in the crowd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your look is part of the performance. Show off your personality\u2014or lack of coordination\u2014in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/97fac52d079da123e754275a1739c6ea.poster.avif?t=1746590644\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/97fac52d079da123e754275a1739c6ea.webm?t=1746590644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer: </strong>Why dance alone when you can throw a full-blown cat rave? <i>Meowingtons Simulator</i> lets you host your own lobby and invite up to <strong>7 friends</strong> to join the chaos. Whether you're showing off your precision timing or just slamming cats into walls for laughs, it\u2019s always better with an audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>text chat</strong> to hype up each other\u2019s moves\u2014or let the <strong>proximity voice chat</strong> do the talking (and the meowing). Hear your friends laughing as you yeet Meowingtons across the room in perfect sync with the drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer is pure mayhem in the best way possible. No pressure, no leaderboard\u2014just cats dancing, flopping, and vibing together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/ac7451732b07f879b782f2d0def4c3c0.poster.avif?t=1746590644\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/ac7451732b07f879b782f2d0def4c3c0.webm?t=1746590644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own Mau5Head:\u00a0</strong>What\u2019s a party without the right headgear? In <i>Meowingtons Simulator</i>, you can collect and combine cosmetic parts to create your very own custom Mau5head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new pieces as you play\u2014LED visors, glowing ears, animated mouth plates, holographic overlays, and more. Mix and match styles to build a look that\u2019s <i>uniquely you</i> (or uniquely cursed).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re going for full rave god mode or minimalist tech drip, your Mau5head is your identity on the dance floor\u2014and yes, it absolutely moves with your physics-flailing head for maximum comedic effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/a5b5c526d68c2e5d2d9d11a6a7bdd8cb.poster.avif?t=1746590644\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/a5b5c526d68c2e5d2d9d11a6a7bdd8cb.webm?t=1746590644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get ready to take control of the most unique dance party ever with Meowingtons and pals! In this ragdoll dancing simulator, you\u2019ll use intuitive controls to move Meowingtons to the beat of the music. Create hilariously chaotic dance routines, time your moves with the rhythm, and make that goofy cat bounce around.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/bfd4c2b6d3cdeb84195732fa3d891ef3.poster.avif?t=1746590644\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/bfd4c2b6d3cdeb84195732fa3d891ef3.webm?t=1746590644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragdoll Dance Mechanics:</strong> In <i>Meowingtons Simulator</i>, every move hits the beat. The dance system is fully synced to the music, meaning each action you take lands perfectly in rhythm\u2014no off-beat flailing allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Meowingtons\u2019 head or butt independently using simple impulse sliders. Launch his limbs, pose mid-air, or smash into the club walls\u2014all while grooving to the track. The result? A glorious mess of rhythm, ragdoll physics, and feline flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the controls to create beautifully synchronized chaos\u2014or just let the beat take control and see what happens. Either way, it\u2019s hilarious, satisfying, and endlessly remixable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/d56