> do the talking (and the meowing). Hear your friends laughing as you yeet Meowingtons across the room in perfect sync with the drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer is pure mayhem in the best way possible. No pressure, no leaderboard\u2014just cats dancing, flopping, and vibing together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/ac7451732b07f879b782f2d0def4c3c0.poster.avif?t=1746590644\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/ac7451732b07f879b782f2d0def4c3c0.webm?t=1746590644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own Mau5Head:\u00a0</strong>What\u2019s a party without the right headgear? In <i>Meowingtons Simulator</i>, you can collect and combine cosmetic parts to create your very own custom Mau5head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new pieces as you play\u2014LED visors, glowing ears, animated mouth plates, holographic overlays, and more. Mix and match styles to build a look that\u2019s <i>uniquely you</i> (or uniquely cursed).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re going for full rave god mode or minimalist tech drip, your Mau5head is your identity on the dance floor\u2014and yes, it absolutely moves with your physics-flailing head for maximum comedic effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/a5b5c526d68c2e5d2d9d11a6a7bdd8cb.poster.avif?t=1746590644\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766880/extras/a5b5c526d68c2e5d2d9d11a6a7bdd8cb.webm?t=1746590