    "short_description": "This isn\u2019t your typical dance game...Explore club Oberhasli and Control meowingtons' movements, every dance is an opportunity to create something unique, funny, or downright absurd. Whether you\u2019re bouncing around on the decks, or find a better place to throw down, there\u2019s no wrong way to dance. neat",
